From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NXP-MR <meta-nxp-mr@nxp.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 16:40:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: nxp: cam_helper: Extend imx708 to imx708_wide

The NXP neo IPA resolves its per-sensor CameraHelper through its own
factory (CameraHelperFactoryBase::create(sensorModel) in neo_ipa.cpp),
which is independent of the generic libipa CameraSensorHelper registry.

The NAVQ95 ships the Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 Wide, whose sensor
reports the model string "imx708_wide". Without a matching NXP camera
helper, neo_ipa.cpp fails with:

    Failed to create camera sensor helper for imx708_wide

and the NxpNeo pipeline fails to initialise the IPA.

The wide module uses the same imx708 sensor (identical analogue gain
model), only a different lens, so register an "imx708_wide" helper that
subclasses CameraHelperImx708 and reuses its gain conversions.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [RPi-specific sensor model suffix]

Signed-off-by: NXP-MR <meta-nxp-mr@nxp.com>
---
 src/ipa/nxp/cam_helper/camera_helper_imx708.cpp | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/ipa/nxp/cam_helper/camera_helper_imx708.cpp b/src/ipa/nxp/cam_helper/camera_helper_imx708.cpp
index 90edeb2..431adba 100644
--- a/src/ipa/nxp/cam_helper/camera_helper_imx708.cpp
+++ b/src/ipa/nxp/cam_helper/camera_helper_imx708.cpp
@@ -32,6 +32,16 @@ double CameraHelperImx708::gain(uint32_t gainCode) const
 
 REGISTER_CAMERA_HELPER("imx708", CameraHelperImx708)
 
+/*
+ * The Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 Wide reports the sensor model as
+ * "imx708_wide". It is the same imx708 sensor with a different lens, so the
+ * gain model is identical; reuse the imx708 helper implementation.
+ */
+class CameraHelperImx708Wide : public CameraHelperImx708
+{
+};
+REGISTER_CAMERA_HELPER("imx708_wide", CameraHelperImx708Wide)
+
 } /* namespace nxp */
 
 } /* namespace libcamera */
